---
name: sanity-run-table
version: 1.3.0
description: Compact sanity reviewer rows, grouped newest run first. Ten runs can contain twenty rows.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - runs
---
| S | PR | R | Find | Result | Done | Iter |
|:--|:--|:--|---:|:--|:--|---:|
{% for run in runs %}| {{ run.sprint }} | {% if run.pr_number %}#{{ run.pr_number }}{% else %}—{% endif %} | {{ run.reviewer_short }} | {% if run.verdict == "CANNOT_RUN" %}—{% else %}{{ run.findings }}{% endif %} | {% if run.verdict == "PASS" %}✅{% elif run.verdict == "FAIL" %}❌{% else %}⚠ unavailable{% endif %} | {{ run.completed_local }} · {{ run.duration }} | {{ run.iteration }} |
{% endfor %}
